  "pageSnippet": "Home How-to Blog Compress Images Online Compress and optimize your JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF and SVG images. This free online tool uses advanced compression algorithms to reduce file sizes while maintaining quality. All processing happens in your browser – your files never leave your device. Drop JPEG, PNG, WebP, GIF or SVG images. Click COMPRESS, then save or adjust quality. Converter Compressor EXIF SELECT FILES CLEAR probe.jpg JPG PROCESSING... ERROR -41% SAVE Drop Your Files Here COMPRESS SAVE ALL 1 probe.jpg Before: 333.5 KB After: 198.1 KB (-41%) 100% Quality APPLY Discover more Online image optimizer JPEG compression tool Online image compression Video File Formats & Codecs Multimedia Software File size reduction Photo & Image Sharing How It Works This tool runs entirely in your browser – no server uploads required. Add your images and click COMPRESS. The tool automatically analyzes each file and selects optimal compression settings. Once processing is complete, you can save the result immediately or use the comparison view to fine-tune quality with the slider. Each image can be adjusted individually before saving. How to compress images — step by step A walk-through guide with screenshots: upload your files, choose JPEG / PNG / WebP quality, compare against the original, save the result. Read the guide → JPEG Compression For JPEG files, the tool detects the original quality level from the file's quantization tables. The default target quality is 80, which provides an excel",
